The 15-run budget and 2-minute runs make this a slow, costly evaluator, so I'm using a single-task shell evaluator on the real `sim_sched.py` with `max_metric_calls` set to 15. There is no dataset, because there is one config and one goal. I've assumed the seed evaluation counts toward the budget.

```json
{
